atch the reference order on the 244 exact-depth ties out of 2M elements, but the depth-sorted sequence is identical. Layer 3: 30-view PSNR min 60.34 dB (north-star >= 60 dB), mean 62.95 dB, max 69.74 dB \u2014 unchanged from iter-009 (the tie reorderings produce sub-1-ULP color differences invisible at fp32 quantisation)."}
